  "question": "A circular field is surrounded by a path of uniform width 2.5 m. The total area of the field, including the path, is 1078.125 m². If the area of the circular field (excluding the path) is 803.25 m², find the radius of the circular field and the radius including the path. (Use π = 3.1416)",
