  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nTotal area = 1078.125\n\nInner area = 803.25\n\nπ = 3.1416\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nArea of circle = π × r²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ π × r² = 803.25\n\n⇒ r² = 803.25 ÷ 3.1416\n\n⇒ r² = 255.75\n\n⇒ r = √255.75 ≈ 15.99 \n\n⇒ π × R² = 1078.125\n\n⇒ R² = 1078.125 ÷ 3.1416\n\n⇒ R² = 343.177043545\n\n⇒ R = √343.177043545 ≈ 18.52\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 15.99 m and 18.52 m.**",
